[4.234000, "o", "\r\u001b[2K"]
[4.234000, "o", "  Because it has one thread. While the command runs, it waits —\r\n"]
[4.280000, "o", "  thirty seconds of build is thirty seconds of nothing.\r\n"]
[4.325000, "o", "  jbx wraps every command the agent runs and lets go of the ones\r\n"]
[4.370000, "o", "  that turn out to be long. The cut is 30s by default; it is set\r\n"]
[4.415000, "o", "  to 10s here so this recording stays watchable.\r\n"]
[4.461000, "o", "\u001b[2m✻ Cogitated for 2s · done 20:05\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[4.461000, "o", "\r\n"]
