[17.222000, "o", "\u001b[2m  ⎿  jbx: this passed 10s, so it is in the BACKGROUND as jcc02a65 — nothing lost.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[17.222000, "o", "\u001b[2m  ⎿  DO NOT WAIT FOR IT, DO SOMETHING ELSE. With nothing else: Monitor\u001b[0m\r\n"]
